  "content": "The final SQL has been submitted successfully (case dw_718).\n\n**Summary of the solution:**\n\nThe query answers: *For each academic year — the academic year, its description, the CV (STDDEV/AVG) of total units for Mathematics fall-term subjects with >0 total units, and the range and variance of TIP enrolled students (>0) in the same scope.*\n\n```sql\nSELECT\n  ata.ACADEMIC_YEAR,\n  ata.ACADEMIC_YEAR_DESC,\n  STDDEV(ccso.TOTAL_UNITS) / AVG(ccso.TOTAL_UNITS) AS coefficient_of_variation_total_units,\n  MAX(tso.NUM_ENROLLED_STUDENTS) - MIN(tso.NUM_ENROLLED_STUDENTS) AS enrollment_range,\n  VARIANCE(tso.NUM_ENROLLED_STUDENTS) AS enrollment_variance\nFROM ACADEMIC_TERMS_ALL ata\nJOIN COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED ccso ON ata.TERM_CODE = ccso.TERM_CODE\nJOIN SUBJECT_OFFERED so ON ccso.TERM_CODE = so.TERM_CODE\nJOIN ACADEMIC_TERMS at ON ccso.TERM_CODE = at.TERM_CODE\nJOIN TIP_SUBJECT_OFFERED tso ON at.TERM_CODE = tso.TERM_CODE\nWHERE ccso.DEPARTMENT_NAME = 'Mathematics'\n  AND ccso.IS_OFFERED_FALL_TERM = 'Y'\n  AND ccso.TOTAL_UNITS > 0\n  AND tso.NUM_ENROLLED_STUDENTS > 0\nGROUP BY ata.ACADEMIC_YEAR, ata.ACADEMIC_YEAR_DESC\nORDER BY ata.ACADEMIC_YEAR\n```\n\nKey design decisions, all grounded in semantic-network evidence:\n- **CV formula** `STDDEV()/AVG()` follows precedent dw_2180/dw_4640; bare `STDDEV` (never STDDEV_POP) per the tip rule.\n- **Math fall-term filter** on `COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED` (`DEPARTMENT_NAME='Mathematics'`, `IS_OFFERED_FALL_TERM='Y'`, `TOTAL_UNITS>0`) follows dw_1023/dw_4229 — it's the only table carrying unit structure plus offering flags (concept_subject_offering_facts decision guide).\n- **Enrollment range/variance** on `TIP_SUBJECT_OFFERED.NUM_ENROLLED_STUDENTS > 0` follows dw_4229 (same TERM_CODE join shape) and dw_3311 (range = MAX−MIN).\n- **Year/description** from `ACADEMIC_TERMS_ALL` per concept_academic_term_dimension (widest term coverage, canonical ACADEMIC_YEAR_DESC source).\n- All five gold tables are connected 